108
00:06:38.106 --> 00:06:39.524
Saya mendengar banyak tentang awak daripada Encik Lee.

109
00:06:39.608 --> 00:06:40.609
Oh, saya faham.

110
00:06:40.692 --> 00:06:42.277
-Mari duduk.
- Pasti.

111
