144
00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:18.373
ya.

145
00:08:18.456 --> 00:08:19.916
[♪ bermain muzik dramatik yang mencengkam]

146
00:08:20.417 --> 00:08:21.501
Tidak, tunggu.

147
00:08:21.876 --> 00:08:22.919
[teragak-agak]

148
00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:26.548
Saya perlu berehat bilik air segera.

149
